           [ 0.995-0.j, -0.964+0.j,  1.   -0.j]],      dtype=complex64, weak_type=True)

    For complex-valued input:

    >>> with jnp.printoptions(precision=3, suppress=True):
    ...   jnp.tanh(2-5j)
    Array(1.031+0.021j, dtype=complex64, weak_type=True)
